OL,3,GNEWSAFootball prescribed to tackle
OL,4,Amental health issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FA repeat prescription of a scheme
OL,7,Fdesigned to offer watching football
OL,8,Fmatches as a way of tackling low mood,
OL,9,Floneliness and other mental health
OL,10,Fissues has been ordered by bosses at a
OL,11,FGloucestershire football club.
OL,13,FThe scheme, which saw GPs refer 30
OL,14,Fpeople to the Forest Green Rovers
OL,15,Fground in Nailsworth last season, was
OL,16,Fpart of a pilot developed by club
OL,17,Fchairman Dale Vince and Labour MP for
OL,18,FStroud Dr Simon Opher.
OL,20,FThe success of the pilot has encouraged
OL,21,Fthe pair to bring the scheme back for
OL,22,Fthe 2026/27 football season.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
