OL,3,GNEWSAFootball prescribed to tackle
OL,4,Amental health issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpher, a GP for 30 years, said he had
OL,7,Fwitnessed first-hand the impact that
OL,8,Feffective social prescribing could have
OL,9,Fon "improving mental health and overall
OL,10,Fwellbeing".
